1347 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Standard Chartered Bank \055 Lead UX\057UI Designer \050Contract via Nuaav\051                                                                                  Apr 2026 \055 Present\nSecured an executive SOW for a 15\055user pilot by designing an end\055to\055end experience for a 6\055agent AI platform\054 automating client intelligence\054 portfolio rebalancing\054 and post\055meeting CRM logging to boost Relationship Manager workflow efficiency by \17637\045\056\nEngineered functional React prototypes using Figma MCP and Claude Code\054 translating complex agent orchestration and deterministic logic into interactive testbeds to validate flows and de\055risk interactions prior to production\056\nChampioned responsible AI design by architecting a transparent Audit UI and evaluation scorecard system\054 mapping every generated recommendation to bank policy clauses to guarantee human\055in\055the\055loop compliance\056\nTashvi\056ai \055 Co\055Founder \046 Lead Product Designer                                                                                                               Mar 2025 \055 May 2026\nLaunched a fully responsive AI jewelry design platform\054 scaling from 0 to 10\054000\053 users and reaching \04450K in ARR within 6 months\056\nAdvocated for the customer through continuous A\057B testing on generative AI workflows\054 reducing user drop\055off across the design pipeline by 22\045 while establishing iterative feedback loops\056\nArchitected a scalable Figma design system using variables\054 tokens\054 and auto\055layout\054 accelerating React frontend development via AI\055assisted workflows \050Cursor\054 Claude Code\051 and rapid prototyping\056\nArrive \055 Sr\056 UX Researcher \050Contract via Craft\051                                                                                                                       Jul 2025 \055 Dec 2025\nFacilitated strategic workshops with senior product and sales leadership across NA and EU\054 pressure\055testing a 2\055year B2B product vision for a \0441B mobility platform that successfully aligned cross\055functional roadmaps and raised the platform\047s internal executive grade from an average \047C\047 to an \047A\047\056\nSpearheaded end\055to\055end research operations for 25\053 customer interviews\054 creating discussion guides\054 outreach templates\054 and compensation logistics\056 Sourced diverse segments by coordinating with Sales and utilizing Craigslist for niche service drivers\054 leveraging Grain AI to rapidly synthesize transcripts into a high\055fidelity vision prototype\056\nZoomInfo \055 UX\057UI Designer III                                                                                                                                                      May 2022 \055 Apr 2024\nTransformed manual search workflows into a conversational\054 AI\055driven discovery interface for ZoomInfo\047s flagship product\054 SalesOS\056 Validated the hybrid chat\055and\055filter UX through usability testing\054 achieving an 87\045 user preference rate and reducing search time by 27\045\056\nCo\055led a design task force to unify the setup of 12 distinct products into a centralized enterprise admin platform\056 Interviewed 50\053 internal PMs and designers to map legacy feature nuances\054 distilling multi\055team provisioning workflows into a streamlined one\055time configuration\054 increasing day\055zero customer satisfaction by 32\045\056\nGoverned Muze\054 a 1\054000\053 component Figma design system\054 standardizing UI across disparate teams while delivering WCAG 2\0561 AA accessibility compliance\056\nJohnson \046 Johnson \055 UX Designer \050Contract via JK Design\051                                                                                            Jun 2021 \055 Feb 2022\nDesigned high\055fidelity mockups for J\046J\031s global ESG reporting platform\054 validating the user experience to achieve a 90\045 navigation preference in usability testing\056\nExpanded the enterprise Figma design system with 30\053 reusable\054 WCAG 2\0561 AA\055compliant components\054 improving cross\055platform consistency and frontend development efficiency\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1348 0 R
     /Pg 1335 0 R
     /S /Span
